<title>FRANCE: French coffee imports up year/year in October.</title>
<headline>French coffee imports up year/year in October.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>French coffee imports in October issued by French customs included (in tonnes) -</p>
<p>- coffee not roasted not decaffeinated -</p>
<p>		   Oct 96	Oct 95     Jan/Oct 96    Jan/Oct 95</p>
<p>Ivory Coast     4,207	 4,736	39,819	  38,686</p>
<p>Cameroon	  1,608	   955	14,778	   8,983</p>
<p>Brazil	    4,820	 4,903	36,915	  45,197</p>
<p>Colombia	  3,342	 2,450	28,173	  26,407</p>
<p>World total    28,624	26,802     268,306	 247,674</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
